@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title SEQ-19 - QUẢN TRỊ SẢN PHẨM & TỒN KHO
actor "Quản trị viên" as A
boundary "Admin Product UI" as UI
control "Product Admin API" as API
control "Product Admin Service" as S
control "Prisma Client" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
A -> UI : Mở quản lý sản phẩm
UI -> API : Tải danh sách
API -> S : requireAdmin() + loadProducts()
S -> P : find Products + Variants
P -> DB : SELECT Product/Variant
S --> API : product data
API --> UI : danh sách
A -> UI : Thêm/sửa sản phẩm, màu, size, stock
UI -> API : POST /api/products
API -> S : normalize variants + validate
S -> P : upsert Product + Variants
P -> DB : UPSERT Product/Variant
S --> API : saved
API --> UI : refresh catalog
@enduml
